        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>PP追奶法</title>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async></script>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #f4a26b;\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #fdf3e3;\n    border: 10px solid #f4a26b;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    padding: 14px 16px 20px;\n  }\n  /* Title */\n  .title-wrap {\n    position: relative;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 8px 0 18px;\n  }\n  .title-blob {\n    display: inline-block;\n    background: #fcd45c;\n    border-radius: 40px;\n    padding: 10px 46px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .title-blob h1 {\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: 40px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    -webkit-text-stroke: 1px #e8a13a;\n  }\n  .spark {\n    color: #fcd45c;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    position: absolute;\n  }\n  .s1 { left: 60px; top: 4px; }\n  .s2 { left: 92px; top: 40px; }\n  .s3 { right: 62px; top: 6px; }\n  .s4 { right: 96px; top: 44px; }\n\n  /* Two columns */\n  .columns {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 14px;\n    align-items: stretch;\n  }\n  .col {\n    flex: 1;\n    border: 1.5px solid #e0b98f;\n    border-radius: 14px;\n    background: #fdf3e3;\n    padding: 6px 8px 14px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .col-head {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin: -18px auto 8px;\n  }\n  .col-head span {\n    display: inline-block;\n    background: #fdeccb;\n    border: 1.5px solid #e0b98f;\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    padding: 6px 14px;\n    font-size: 21px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: #4a3a2a;\n  }\n  .step {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 15.5px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #3d3128;\n    margin: 12px 0;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n  .col:first-child .step { font-size: 15px; }\n  .step.pink { color: #f2607f; }\n  .arrow {\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #f04a4a;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 0.8;\n    margin: 2px 0;\n  }\n\n  /* Notes box */\n  .notes {\n    margin-top: 16px;\n    border: 1.5px solid #e0b98f;\n    border-radius: 14px;\n    padding: 12px 14px;\n    font-size: 15.5px;\n    line-height: 1.85;\n    color: #3d3128;\n  }\n  .notes p {\n    margin: 0 0 2px;\n    text-indent: 0;\n  }\n  .dia { color: #f5b942; font-size: 13px; }\n  .u-orange { border-bottom: 2px solid #f0a13c; }\n  .u-blue { border-bottom: 2px solid #8ab6e8; }\n  .circle {\n    border: 2px solid #f0a13c;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    padding: 0 4px;\n  }\n  .hl { background: linear-gradient(transparent 60%, #ffe9a8 60%); }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"title-wrap\">\n    <span class=\"spark s1\">✦</span>\n    <span class=\"spark s2\">✦</span>\n    <span class=\"spark s3\">✦</span>\n    <span class=\"spark s4\">✦</span>\n    <div class=\"title-blob\">\n      <h1>PP追奶法</h1>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"columns\">\n    <div class=\"col\">\n      <div class=\"col-head\"><span>单边吸奶器</span></div>\n      <div class=\"step\">左边吸10分钟，右边吸10分钟</div>\n      <div class=\"arrow\">▼</div>\n      <div class=\"step pink\">休息5分钟</div>\n      <div class=\"arrow\">▼</div>\n      <div class=\"step\">左边吸10分钟，右边吸10分钟</div>\n      <div class=\"arrow\">▼</div>\n      <div class=\"step pink\">休息5分钟</div>\n      <div class=\"arrow\">▼</div>\n      <div class=\"step\">左边吸10分钟，右边吸10分钟</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"col\">\n      <div class=\"col-head\"><span>双边吸奶器</span></div>\n      <div class=\"step\">双边吸20分钟基础排空</div>\n      <div class=\"arrow\">▼</div>\n      <div class=\"step pink\">按摩10分钟预备排后奶</div>\n      <div class=\"arrow\">▼</div>\n      <div class=\"step\">双边吸10分钟排出后奶</div>\n      <div class=\"arrow\">▼</div>\n      <div class=\"step pink\">休息10分钟</div>\n      <div class=\"arrow\">▼</div>\n      <div class=\"step\">双边吸10分钟泌乳信号</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"notes\">\n    <p><span class=\"dia\">◆</span>PP法进行的最佳时间是晚上11点到次日凌晨5点，这个时间段是<span class=\"u-orange\">泌乳高峰期</span>，✦尽量每天选固定的一个小时进行。</p>\n    <p><span class=\"dia\">◆</span>三次吸奶中间有5~10分钟的休息时间，<span class=\"u-orange\">小口喝一些温开水</span>，有助于血液循环，另外，配合手掌轻轻按摩乳头，或者用<span class=\"hl\">热毛巾敷一敷乳房</span>，有助于刺激奶阵的产生。</p>\n    <p><span class=\"dia\">◆</span>后续如果没有<span class=\"circle\">奶阵</span>了不要空吸，将吸奶器换成按摩泌乳模式继续可以吸出奶阵。</p>\n    <p><span class=\"dia\">◆</span>吸奶器是否适合自己也很关键，有时候吸不出奶和吸奶器也有关系。</p>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
